DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ddwwmmsshhcc driver provides support for the Synopsys DesignWare Mobile
     Storage Host Controller core.  This core is used on the Rockchip RK3566
     and RK3568 SoCs as the eMMC controller.

     The Synopsys DesignWare Mobile Storage Host Controller core implements
     the SD Host Controller Standard Simplified Specification, but requires
     non-standard support for high clock rates.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     the MMC/SD/SDIO devices connected to the controller.

